{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32861","headline":"府试老人星见 · 李频","name":"府试老人星见","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"良宵出户庭，极目向青冥。\n海内逢康日，天边见寿星。\n临空遥的的，竟晓独荧荧。\n春後先依景，秋来忽近丁。\n垂休临有道，作瑞掩前经。\n岂比周王梦，徒言得九龄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李频","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32861.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32861","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}